OL,3,GNEWSAFailure to modernise surgical
OL,4,Aservices risks making things worse -
OL,5,Asurgeons speak out
OL,6,
OL,7,FA leading surgeon has said failing to
OL,8,Fmodernise surgical services could risk
OL,9,Fmaking staff pressures and patient
OL,10,Foutcomes in Northern Ireland worse.
OL,12,FIt comes after Mike Nesbitt resigned as
OL,13,Fhealth minister following a row with
OL,14,FUUP leader Jon Burrows over withdrawing
OL,15,Femergency general surgery (EGS) from
OL,16,FCauseway Hospital.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
